00:16:28.947 --> 00:16:32.326
Sekarang, dengan bangga aku menyambut

00:16:33.702 --> 00:16:34.953
Judy Heumann.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:50.594
Hai.

00:16:50.677 --> 00:16:51.845
Hai.

00:16:55.057 --> 00:16:57.935
Aku dilarang sekolah
sampai usiaku sepuluh tahun.

00:17:00.812 --> 00:17:02.481
Setiap tahun,

00:17:02.564 --> 00:17:05.943
ibuku menyeret kursi rodaku menaiki tangga

00:17:07.402 --> 00:17:09.695
