00:17:34.388 --> 00:17:35.639
Astaga.

00:17:35.722 --> 00:17:36.974
Berisiko.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:39.101
Memalukan!

00:17:39.184 --> 00:17:40.769
Dan aku bilang kepada pramugari,

00:17:40.853 --> 00:17:43.856
