00:18:56.094 --> 00:18:56.929
Semuanya.

00:18:57.012 --> 00:18:57.846
Judy.

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.223
Kita akan masuk!

00:18:59.306 --> 00:19:00.599
Judy?

00:19:00.682 --> 00:19:03.894
Semuanya! Ambil barang kalian, kita masuk!

00:19:04.561 --> 00:19:05.979
Ya!

00:19:06.063 --> 00:19:07.814
Kita akan masuk!

00:19:07.898 --> 00:19:09.107
Judy? Judy.

00:19:09.191 --> 00:19:10.275
Ayo.

00:19:11.818 --> 00:19:14.029
Ayo, kita akan masuk!

00:19:14.112 --> 00:19:15.113
504!

