00:20:44.286 --> 00:20:45.287
Ayo, gerak!

00:20:57.424 --> 00:20:59.718
Lantai empat.

00:20:59.801 --> 00:21:02.596
Semuanya, lantai empat. Terus jalan.

00:21:02.679 --> 00:21:06.308
504! 504!

